e":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":2434204082,"text":"容彩祭にいらしている方たちに、「花影瑶庭」の素晴らしさを伝えられるよう、これから数日間、私はここで案内をしてまいります。","nextNodeIds":[726870202]},{"nodeId":726870202,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":151836690,"text":"お二方も「花題」を毎日解くのを忘れないでください。合計で四つの「花題」を用意していますので。","nextNodeIds":[726870203]},{"nodeId":726870203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":845616874,"text":"もちろん、何かご質問がありましたら、私もできる限りお答えいたします。","nextNodeIds":[726870204,726870210,726870222]},{"nodeId":726870204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4206709530,"text":"ここのお花について…","nextNodeIds":[726870205]},{"nodeId":726870205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":919871594,"text":"私が使っている花材はすべて、「咲耶の花屋」が提供してくれたものです。「咲耶の花屋」が栽培しているお花は、手頃な価格ながらもどれも質がいいんです。","nextNodeIds":[726870206]},{"nodeId":726870206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":1719476458,"text":"あなたたちは、すでに咲耶さんと会ったことがあるかもしれませんね。私たちは同じ先生のもとで「生け花」を学びました。","nextNodeIds":[726870207]},{"nodeId":726870207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":3009817834,"text":"花芸について、咲耶さんも深い見識を持っています。ただ、容彩祭に大勢の人が来ることを聞いた途端、少し緊張してしまったようです。こういった環境では、落ち着いて生け花ができないとか。","nextNodeIds":[726870208]},{"nodeId":726870208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":2499178986,"text":"ですので、私が代わりに「咲耶の花屋」を皆さんに勧めています。","nextNodeIds":[726870209]},{"nodeId":726870209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2082577922,"text":"機会があったら、オイラたちも手伝ってやるぞ！","nextNodeIds":[726870219]},{"nodeId":726870219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":1010027682,"text":"他に何か質問はありますか？","nextNodeIds":[726870220]},{"nodeId":726870220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3067219490,"text":"ありがとう、柴染さん。","nextNodeIds":[726870221]},{"nodeId":726870221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":139603770,"text":"いえ、どういたしまして。時間がありましたら、いつでも来てください。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":726870210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1503724594,"text":"社奉行について…","nextNodeIds":[726870211]},{"nodeId":726870211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":2797110330,"text":"社奉行は、これまで稲妻の花芸事業を支えてきてくれました。もっと言うと、今回の催しのために出資してくださった貴人は、まさにあの白鷺の姫君なのです。","nextNodeIds":[726870212]},{"nodeId":726870212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":2496297666,"text":"白鷺の姫君は幼少の頃より、花芸に対して素晴らしい才を見せていました。私はあの方が花を生ける姿を見たことがあり、その心得についても語り合ったことがあります。","nextNodeIds":[726870213]},{"nodeId":726870213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":1508383266,"text":"私のほうが年上ではありますが、生け花の技術も花芸に対する理解も、あの方には及びません。","nextNodeIds":[726870214]},{"nodeId":726870214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":1416659450,"text":"状況が許す限り、白鷺の姫君は「生け花」の持つ芸術性を広めるため、資金を毎年提供してくれます。時には、自分の貯蓄を使うこともあるようです…","nextNodeIds":[726870215]},{"nodeId":726870215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":2580369618,"text":"白鷺の姫君は、以前このように自分の胸の内を打ち明けたことがありました——「生け花」をより多くの人に知ってもらい、花芸に興味を持っていただいて、それに精通してほしいと。","nextNodeIds":[726870216]},{"nodeId":726870216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1890863482,"text":"綾華、稲妻の花芸のためにそんなに頑張ってたんだな…","nextNodeIds":[726870217]},{"nodeId":726870217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3694582458,"text":"彼女の願いが叶うといい。","nextNodeIds":[726870218]},{"nodeId":726870218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":1842969362,"text":"ありがとうございます。お二方とも思いやりに溢れた方々なのですね。","nextNodeIds":[726870219]},{"nodeId":726870222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1782352058,"text":"もう大丈夫。","nextNodeIds":[726870223]},{"nodeId":726870223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":3508514954,"text":"時間がありましたら、いつでも来てください。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_GAME_TIME_TICK","PPFLKMOMKAI":"8,12"}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}},{"subQuestId":7269002,"order":2,"stepDescription":"柴染と会話する","stepDescTextMapHash":1571320412,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7269002,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30171"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[7269001],"talks":[{"talkId":7269001,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","beginCond":[{"param":["7269002","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7269001,"initDialog":726900101,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[30171],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Inazuma_72690/Q7269001","priority":5,"questId":72690,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":726900101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":3094680970,"text":"お二方、ついにこの日が訪れました。","nextNodeIds":[726900102]},{"nodeId":726900102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":607847922,"text":"「花影瑶庭」の構図を作るにあたり、あなたたちはその真髄を究めました。","nextNodeIds":[726900103]},{"nodeId":726900103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":1005275050,"text":"ここより先は、花芸における真の試練となります。","nextNodeIds":[726900104]},{"nodeId":726900104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2585777826,"text":"えっ？オイラたちもう花芸の真髄を掴んだのか？","nextNodeIds":[726900105]},{"nodeId":726900105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3569534130,"text":"真の試練って、つまり一番難しい花題ってことだろ。オイラ、なんだか不安になってきた…","nextNodeIds":[726900106]},{"nodeId":726900106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":435802410,"text":"まだ始めてそんなに経ってないのに。","nextNodeIds":[726900107]},{"nodeId":726900107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":2783220962,"text":"花材を作る技術でしたら、確かに長い時間をかけて磨き続ける必要があります。ですが、「花庭」の景観と構成を考えるのは、むしろ感覚とひらめきのほうが大事なのです。","nextNodeIds":[726900108]},{"nodeId":726900108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":1299154442,"text":"後者だけであれば、お二方は驚くべき天賦を見せてくれました。「花題」という鍛錬はもう必要ありません。","nextNodeIds":[726900109]},{"nodeId":726900109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":2139881282,"text":"これも魅力ある旅を通じて、私が想像もできないような景色を見てきたからなのかもしれません。だから、一般の人とは違う心境を持っているのでしょう。","nextNodeIds":[726900110]},{"nodeId":726900110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3808922658,"text":"そ、そうなのかな…","nextNodeIds":[726900111]},{"nodeId":726900111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3101593130,"text":"でも確かに、オイラたちって色んなところに行ったよな。旅をすると、ひらめきもたくさん生まれるってことか…","nextNodeIds":[726900112]},{"nodeId":726900112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2756778786,"text":"オイラたち、ここ数日花芸を学んできたけど、どれくらいひらめきを使っちゃったんだろうな？","nextNodeIds":[726900113,726900114]},{"nodeId":726900113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3907299690,"text":"旅はまだまだ続くから。","nextNodeIds":[726900115]},{"nodeId":726900115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2073126634,"text":"ああ、確かにそうだな！","nextNodeIds":[726900116]},{"nodeId":726900116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1947795882,"text":"ありがとな、柴染さん！おまえのおかげで、こんな才能があることにオイラたち初めて気づけたぜ！","nextNodeIds":[726900117]},{"nodeId":726900117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":1112072930,"text":"いえ、どういたしまして。では、もっとも美しい「花庭」で、今回の花芸体験を終わらせましょう。","nextNodeIds":[726900118,726900122]},{"nodeId":726900118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3556382538,"text":"うん、花題を出して。","nextNodeIds":[726900119]},{"nodeId":726900119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":3120222042,"text":"それでは、本日の花題は——","nextNodeIds":[726900120]},{"nodeId":726900120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":4265833466,"text":"「曲がる枝は虹の如し、鮮やかに彩る」。","nextNodeIds":[726900121]},{"nodeId":726900121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":1857415210,"text":"あなたたちの技術の集大成である「花影瑶庭」を楽しみにしています。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":726900122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":862395922,"text":"他に用事がある…","nextNodeIds":[726900123]},{"nodeId":726900123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":496379146,"text":"ええ、それでしたら大丈夫です。花を生けるには、心を落ち着かせる必要がありますから。","nextNodeIds":[726900124]},{"nodeId":726900124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30171,"speakerName":"柴染","textMapHash":3358082306,"text":"用事を済ませ、喧噪から離れた時、花題にある「花庭」をより完璧なものにすることができるでしょう。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":726900114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":363469474,"text":"ひらめきは積み重なっていくから。","nextNodeIds":[726900115]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7269002,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","